    LIM -->|"Finite repair resources"| RP
    LIM -->|"Finite development resources"| GE
    CH -->|"Changes membership or connections"| ORG
    CH -->|"Changes interfaces"| IF
    CH -->|"May change governing mechanisms"| LAW
    PE -->|"Actually available experience"| PM
    PI -->|"Current policy under review"| PM
    GO -->|"Owned review criteria"| PM
    AD -->|"Implements a new policy version"| PI
    AD -->|"May implement structural change"| CH
    AD -->|"May change information channels"| SE
